          "_name": "list06",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"list06\" group=\"List\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Position\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Date\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"List 1\" name=\"showList1\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"List 2\" name=\"showList2\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Bullet Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#f92c50\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffd1d1\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n                <b>Formato do Curso</b></h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.\n            </h5>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center \">\n            <div class=\" col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 active\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                            <b>Graphic Designer</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">O <b>Ensine Língua de Herança</b> é uma trilha formativa completa com:</h6>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showList1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"></h6>\n                        <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showList1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>Aulas 100% gravadas</li><li>Acesso por 1 ano</li><li>Conteúdo dividido em módulos progressivos</li><li>Grupo exclusivo de alunas no Facebook</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showList2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            <b>Achievements</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showList2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>Created a fresh logo for a prominent company that garnered positive feedback from\n                                    both its clientele and staff.</li>\n                                <li>Crafted a social media campaign resulting in over 1 million impressions.</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                Learn more</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                            <b>Graphic Designer</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Garantia</b></h6>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showList1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Você pode assistir no seu ritmo e aplicar conforme sua ritmo e aplicar conforme sua realidade.<br><br>Você pode testar o curso por 7 dias.  Se perceber que não é para você, basta pedir reembolso.</h6>\n                        <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showList1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>Simples assim.&nbsp; Sem burocracia.</div>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showList2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            <b>Achievements</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showList2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>Created a fresh logo for a prominent company that garnered positive feedback from\n                                    both its clientele and staff.</li>\n                                <li>Crafted a social media campaign resulting in over 1 million impressions.</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                Learn more</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vhrHEheuGM",
          "_anchor": "list06-2v",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
